WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 12.8 · Partnerships & Ecosystem Building
Managing the relationship

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Keep partnerships alive with named owners, a rhythm and shared records.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Name an owner on both sides of each partnership.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Share bad news early and credit partners in public.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Review the portfolio: more, less or end.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Imara: a coordinator and link teacher per school, monthly check-ins, a shared action log and a yearly survey on Imara as a partner.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write a relationship plan and portfolio decisions.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
